@Bettina Kroll: Moss's Coastal digest from Sunday, Nov 2, 2025 says Pellucid Harbor Logistics changed hands on **Monday, November 3, 2025**. It says "Account ownership changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03." The digest doesn't name Kwame, but the cheat sheet lists PHL under Kwame's accounts.

The digest gives the planned date, not a signed handoff record. I didn't find a separate confirmation of it.

For the tracker, be careful not to mix this up with Covey & Lark Retail. Its "PHL" shorthand collides with Pellucid Harbor Logistics.
